.nh
.TH containers-storage-add-names 1 "August 2016"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-add-names \- Add names to a layer/image/container

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBadd-names\fP [\fIoptions\fP [...]] \fIlayerOrImageOrContainerNameOrID\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
In addition to IDs, \fIlayers\fP, \fIimages\fP, and \fIcontainers\fP can have
human-readable names assigned to them in \fIcontainers-storage\fP\&.  The \fIadd-names\fP
command can be used to add one or more names to them.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-n | --name\fP \fIname\fP

.PP
Specifies a name to add to the layer, image, or container.  If a specified name
is already used by another layer, image, or container, it is removed from that
other layer, image, or container.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage add-names \\
 -n my-awesome-container \\
 -n my-for-realsies-awesome-container \\
 f3be6c6134d0d980936b4c894f1613b69a62b79588fdeda744d0be3693bde8ec
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
containers-storage-get-names(1)
containers-storage-remove-names(1)
containers-storage-set-names(1)
